# Exact versions only: `pnpm add` writes "1.2.3", never "^1.2.3". Every install reads
# pnpm-lock.yaml, so the ranges were never consulted by a correct build; an incorrect
# one let them decide (nostrology-web#2). An upgrade is deliberate: bump the specifier,
# regenerate the lockfile, let CI test it, deploy.
save-prefix=''
